{"speciesId":310,"names":{"fr":"Élecsprint","es":"Manectric","en":"Manectric","ja":"ライボルト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MANECTRIC is constantly discharging electricity from its mane. The sparks sometimes ignite forest fires. When it enters a battle, this POKéMON creates thunderclouds."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MANECTRIC discharges strong electricity from its mane. The mane is used for collecting electricity in the atmosphere. This POKéMON creates thunderclouds above its head."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Because lightning falls in their vicinities, MANECTRIC were thought to have been born from lightning. In battle, they create thunderclouds."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its nest can be found where a thunderbolt hits. It is discharging electricity from its mane."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its nest can be found where a thunderbolt hits. It is discharging electricity from its mane."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il libère l’électricité par sa crinière. Il crée un nuage d’orage pour appeler la foudre."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il libère l’électricité par sa crinière. Il crée un nuage d’orage pour appeler la foudre."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon évite le contact des humains. On raconte qu’il fait son nid là où la foudre est déjà tombée."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No suele aparecer ante la gente. Dicen que suele colocar su nido donde caen los rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"人前には めったに 姿を 見せない。 雷の 落ちた 場所に 住処が あると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il libère l’électricité par sa crinière. Il crée un nuage d’orage pour appeler la foudre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Descarga electricidad desde su melena. Crea nubarrones desde los que lanza rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"たてがみから 放電している。 頭上に 雷雲を 作り 稲妻を 落として 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La crinière d’Élecsprint libère constamment de l’électricité. Les étincelles déclenchent parfois des feux de forêt. Au début de ses combats, ce Pokémon crée des nuages orageux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Manectric está continuamente descargando electricidad por las melenas, y a veces causa incendios en el bosque con las chispas que suelta. Cuando entra en combate, este Pokémon crea nubarrones."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Manectric is constantly discharging electricity from its mane. The sparks sometimes ignite forest fires. When it enters a battle, this Pokémon creates thunderclouds."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"たてがみから いつも 放電しているため 火花で 山火事を 起してしまう ことも。 戦いに なると 雷雲を つくりだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Élecsprint peut libérer un courant intense de sa crinière. Cette crinière lui permet de récupérer l’électricité de l’atmosphère. Ce Pokémon peut créer des nuages orageux au-dessus de sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Manectric acumula en las melenas la electricidad que hay en el ambiente, y la descarga a través de ellas en grandes dosis. Este Pokémon crea nubarrones que se le quedan por encima de la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Manectric discharges strong electricity from its mane. The mane is used for collecting electricity in the atmosphere. This Pokémon creates thunderclouds above its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"たてがみから 強い 電気を 発している。 空気中の 電気を たてがみに 集め 頭の 上に 雷雲を つくりだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Si un nuage orageux un peu louche apparaît dans le ciel, un Élecsprint se trouve sûrement en dessous. On le dit aussi rapide que l’éclair."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cuando se dan nubes de tormenta un tanto inusuales, este Pokémon suele hallarse debajo. Se dice que se mueve a la velocidad del rayo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Manectric can be found beneath unnatural thunderclouds. People say it can run at the same speed as lightning striking."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"不自然な 雷雲の 下には ライボルトが いる。 雷と 同じ スピードで 駆けると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il diffuse de l’électricité dans ses membres pour augmenter sa vitesse. C’est également ainsi qu’il apaise ses douleurs musculaires."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La electricidad estimula su musculatura para que pueda moverse a gran velocidad y le ayuda a recuperarse del dolor muscular rápidamente."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It stimulates its own muscles with electricity, so it can move quickly. It eases its soreness with electricity, too, so it can recover quickly as well."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"電気で 筋肉を 刺激するので 素早く 動ける。 筋肉痛も 電気で ほぐすので すぐ 治る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il diffuse de l’électricité dans ses membres pour augmenter sa vitesse. C’est également ainsi qu’il apaise ses douleurs musculaires."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La electricidad estimula su musculatura para que pueda moverse a gran velocidad y le ayuda a recuperarse del dolor muscular rápidamente."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It stimulates its own muscles with electricity, so it can move quickly. It eases its soreness with electricity, too, so it can recover quickly as well."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"電気で 筋肉を 刺激するので 素早く 動ける。 筋肉痛も 電気で ほぐすので すぐ 治る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon évite de se montrer aux humains. On raconte qu’il fait son nid aux endroits où la foudre s’est abattue."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Rara vez aparece ante la gente. Dicen que suele colocar su madriguera donde caen rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"人前には めったに 姿を 見せない。 雷の 落ちた 場所に すみかが あると いう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":310,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":